{"2824750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Collector's Edition", "steam_appid": 2824750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Collect Everything Game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Thrill of the Hunt - Coins, Cards, Antiques, Art, and more!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse classifieds for rare finds, study every photo, and plan your visit. Some deals are gold, others are scams. Can you tell which is which?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/dc4f9f7ef6ae98e482462d398991bd59.poster.avif?t=1787089582\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/dc4f9f7ef6ae98e482462d398991bd59.webm?t=1787089582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/dc4f9f7ef6ae98e482462d398991bd59.mp4?t=1787089582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Appraise &amp; Negotiate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magnifiers, lighting tools, and expert references to judge authenticity, condition, and value. Can you spot a minor error or misprint that adds value? Charm, bluff, or bully eccentric sellers to score a deal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/710c447b0f61f06f6273c2e885c5aa8c.poster.avif?t=1787089582\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/710c447b0f61f06f6273c2e885c5aa8c.webm?t=1787089582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/710c447b0f61f06f6273c2e885c5aa8c.mp4?t=1787089582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your online storefront</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph, list, and sell your finds in your auction marketplace. The photos you take matter. What will you use as the primary photo, what angle shows the item best? Will you avoid unsightly details and risk a negative review or be upfront and honest about the items you list?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/b9b70b4ff4eac0c7f0939d8fca0e6c82.avif?t=1787089582\" width=1232 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your collector’s den</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your space with prized finds and show off your growing empire. What will you keep just for yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/fdc2bbe01a154c58478965937540a7ba.avif?t=1787089582\" width=1232 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rise to Fame in the Collector’s League</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in regional events, climb global rankings, and prove your expertise across categories from coins to comics. Earn titles, awards, and invitations to exclusive sales.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Collect Everything Game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Thrill of the Hunt - Coins, Cards, Antiques, Art, and more!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse classifieds for rare finds, study every photo, and plan your visit. Some deals are gold, others are scams. Can you tell which is which?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/dc4f9f7ef6ae98e482462d398991bd59.poster.avif?t=1787089582\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/dc4f9f7ef6ae98e482462d398991bd59.webm?t=1787089582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/dc4f9f7ef6ae98e482462d398991bd59.mp4?t=1787089582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Appraise &amp; Negotiate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magnifiers, lighting tools, and expert references to judge authenticity, condition, and value. Can you spot a minor error or misprint that adds value? Charm, bluff, or bully eccentric sellers to score a deal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/710c447b0f61f06f6273c2e885c5aa8c.poster.avif?t=1787089582\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/710c447b0f61f06f6273c2e885c5aa8c.webm?t=1787089582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/710c447b0f61f06f6273c2e885c5aa8c.mp4?t=1787089582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your online storefront</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph, list, and sell your finds in your auction marketplace. The photos you take matter. What will you use as the primary photo, what angle shows the item best? Will you avoid unsightly details and risk a negative review or be upfront and honest about the items you list?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/b9b70b4ff4eac0c7f0939d8fca0e6c82.avif?t=1787089582\" width=1232 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your collector’s den</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your space with prized finds and show off your growing empire. What will you keep just for yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/extras/fdc2bbe01a154c58478965937540a7ba.avif?t=1787089582\" width=1232 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rise to Fame in the Collector’s League</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in regional events, climb global rankings, and prove your expertise across categories from coins to comics. Earn titles, awards, and invitations to exclusive sales.</p>", "short_description": "Hunt treasures at garage sales, inspect every flaw, and haggle with eccentric sellers. Photograph your finds, choose the right headline and list them online to flip for a profit. Keep the best for your private collection. It's the Collect Everything Game!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/99047cdf54128f90075e871a4ef42f569b409acb/header.jpg?t=1787089582", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/aef232322f78f99505afbcd7046b662307535df6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787089582", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824750/aef232322f78f99505afbcd7046b662307535df6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787089582", "website": "https://ludosystems.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD processor